<v Guest>what the project is not meant to do.

302
00:18:52.820 --> 00:18:58.380
<v Guest>I'm mostly not doing open source every single weekend, every single weeknight.

303
00:18:58.720 --> 00:19:00.560
<v Guest>I'll take breaks of weeks or more.

